{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"FoundationEssentials"}],"symbolKind":"protocol","roleHeading":"Protocol","title":"ParseStrategy","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"12.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"15.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"8.0"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ParseStrategy","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:20FoundationEssentials13ParseStrategyP","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ParseStrategy","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ParseStrategy"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Se","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Decodable"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SE","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Encodable"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy","isActive":true},{"text":" allows you to convert a formatted representation into a data type, using one of two approaches:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initialize the data type by calling an initializer of that type that takes a formatted instance and a parse strategy as parameters. For example, you can create a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" from a formatted string with the initializer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Decimal.init(_:format:lenient:)"},{"type":"text","text":" from the FoundationInternationalization module."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Create a parse strategy and call its ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/parse(_:)","isActive":true},{"text":" method on one or more formatted instances.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy","type":"reference"},{"text":" is closely related to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/FormatStyle"},{"text":", which provides the opposite conversion: from data type to formatted representation. To use a parse strategy, you create a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/FormatStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" to define the representation you expect, then access the style’s "},{"code":"parseStrategy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property to get a strategy instance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example creates a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Decimal.FormatStyle.Currency","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" format style (as provided by FoundationInternationlization) that uses US dollars and US English number-formatting conventions. It then creates a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/Decimal"},{"text":" instance by providing a formatted string to parse and the format style’s `Decimal.FormatStyle.Currency.parseStrategy``.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let style = Decimal.FormatStyle.Currency(code: \"USD\",","locale: Locale(identifier: \"en_US\"))","let parsed = try? Decimal(\"$12,345.67\",","strategy: style.parseStrategy) \/\/ 12345.67"]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/foundationessentials\/parsestrategy"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseableFormatStyle"],"anchor":"Data-parsing","generated":true,"title":"Data parsing"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/ParseInput","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/ParseOutput"],"anchor":"Associated-Types","title":"Associated Types"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/parse(_:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/http-1oj46","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/http-952ct","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/iso8601-2oypx","doc:\/\/FoundationEssentials\/documentation\/FoundationEssentials\/ParseStrategy\/iso8601-2pu9d"],"anchor":"Type-Propertie